            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[<h2>Claude Code in PyCharm</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Automatically retains Claude Code's native session and the active PyCharm project when delegating an NHI task.</li>
  <li>Waits until PyCharm has opened the project before opening Terminal and sending the Claude resume command.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
